<p> </p>

<div style="float:right; padding-left: 30px;">
<a href="<%BASEURL%>otc" target="_blank"><div class="onj-home-thumbnail-div"><img src="<%BASEURL%>design/aggregations/all/uploads/otc-thumb.png" alt="Open Textbook Collaborative" title="Open Textbook Collaborative" /><br />Highlighted<br />Collection</div></a>
</div>
<br />
<p style="line-height:1.6;">The Open NJ repository allows faculty and students to find Open Educational Resources (OER) created and adopted at participating New Jersey institutions along with materials created through the <a href="<%BASEURL%>otc">Open Textbook Collaborative</a> grant. By sharing this common space, OpenNJ enables faculty to share OER, expand their knowledge of adopted OER, and identify OER for their potential adoption.  Approved members of the academic community can also submit OER online through the integrated OpenPublishing tool.  (<a href="<%BASEURL%>info/aboutopennj">learn more</a> <!--<a href="<%BASEURL%>browseby">browse by metadata</a>--> )</p>

<!--<p>Reported cost savings as of August 2020: $210,101,579 (based on 22 institutions).</p>-->


